      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-abolition-of-limited-merits-review-act-2017.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions\n\nA decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local\nenergy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however\ndescribed) by a body established under a law of a State or\nTerritory.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions\n\nA decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local\nenergy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however\ndescribed) by a body established under a law of a State or\nTerritory.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-abolition-of-limited-merits-review-act-2017-sch-1-sec-2-norm"
        },
