      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-abolition-of-limited-merits-review-act-2017.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by Part 1 of this Schedule to insert\nsection 44AIA of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 applies in\nrelation to a decision that is made before, on or after the commencement\nof this Schedule.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by Part 1 of this Schedule to insert\nsection 44AIA of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 applies in\nrelation to a decision that is made before, on or after the commencement\nof this Schedule.",
